      "writtenOn": "2024-01-06T00:13:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this a search operation. Popping a transaction from the transaction stack should always pop the top of the stack. If the current thread is not the target thread for the transaction at the top of the stack user-space is doing something illegal and should get an error back already from line 160",
      "revId": "0dfd18dc7d1428993739d87d1ab015e8424b4393",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
